{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CfY2BLeLdeXXcY6x4U19a","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Answer: Higo\nActions taken: none\nReading the rule as requiring at least 6 office weeks and no remote day in the 10 days before 2046-07-17 (2046-07-07 to 07-16), only Higo qualifies. Higo has 9 office weeks and last worked remotely on 07-03, outside that window. Nobizi (4 weeks, 07-08) and Rihawu (3 weeks, 07-10) fail both conditions. Wagiyu has 6 weeks but was remote on 07-11. If the exception instead waives the 6-week minimum, several interns would qualify and there would be no single answer."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":409,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":469,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":262},"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"diagnostics":null}